<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila has become the leader of a rebel coalition that includes the M23 movement and is attacking Congolese government forces in eastern DRC. The FRN reported that rebel forces captured several positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting, and the United States sanctioned Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama for supplying the rebels. Ebola workers are confronting an outbreak that has exceeded 5,000 deaths, prompting WHO warnings of a continent-wide spread. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9lWUlWZ29nYmstUnhiaXhNeHFGYmRGbXJZV1JKc3BBMVdvTGlWcFdxRUNpQkR2RTJFSUtmdDdWNzF1RTJrM1VGRVBZOWZJM3c5UWlmMWRVdnBOVjc4d1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9RRzc3TV8zSVE0OGRpc1FKOVpyRWpMdDdaTGlsbmhERXFqdzRQMEwwOURLd0JodG16LVJOUFhwaTFiY2xzOE1qRlRQOXZiaHJmYlNtdFg4c3RTMkU?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxObGpuZmNUb3V5UldYUHhXdXZHOU9TQm9SalVHUnEzR3dPQUdsV2JFSkZEMXJNMkdPdDJwV2V4MVp2U05hU3RzWWJlOGhvU0JsNnJta0NWVFBPUlNPRGhNVUVoQk05bWdpaDJhZElvRHlSMk5sekhLYXo0eGwxckZrdlZpR1d5WnAzSVNDaUhpTU40RkF4Xy1hMFRMUEhoN2l0SjFQQUd5M0JHTjdsdUxBNDNPYXlFYjdDTWZoOEhiUGxUeFhNeW9NcEtWYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSEFfLTl5YmZORE1hZlBXWHhYTUs0c1A3VUJyUWtNQVZfV1oyNlEyeWNzYU9ILWhrMDU4SjlOS2dKT0pBZFNLQ3NBZi1KQ20wOGNaNEFkN2drTEFqaDNVdnBFVGJJM1NpNDJSZ0VCUXN4SEdPM3BBbmRKbkR0NzJ4U0Y5VkdQYzE1eHdWYnNTWVQwTk9uVXd5bUlsZFpLWEE4N0hvWA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The EastAfrican&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FV